ull_request_review_id":3865699956,"id":2863210288,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6qqR8w","diff_hunk":"@@ -27,10 +29,13 @@\n \t</methods>\n \t<members>\n \t\t<member name=\"bar_beats\" type=\"int\" setter=\"set_bar_beats\" getter=\"get_bar_beats\" default=\"4\">\n+\t\t\tThe number of beats within a single bar in the audio track. See [member ResourceImporterMP3.bar_beats].\n \t\t</member>\n \t\t<member name=\"beat_count\" type=\"int\" setter=\"set_beat_count\" getter=\"get_beat_count\" default=\"0\">\n+\t\t\tThe length of the audio track, in beats. See [member ResourceImporterMP3.beat_count].","path":"modules/mp3/doc_classes/AudioStreamMP3.xml","commit_id":"529c859710e06386210d8173c81662e7d304ff7b","original_commit_id":"529c859710e06386210d8173c81662e7d304ff7b","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm not sure what `ResourceImporterMP3.beat_count` does but I'd say \"length in beats\" and \"number of beats\" are different.\n\"number of beats\" / \"beat count\" would imply to me that an algorithm has counted the beats and is returning this number.\n\"length in beats\" would imply to me that some beat length is assumed and you're returning `track_duration / beat_duration`.\nThe difference would be most obvious if there's a tempo switch or a beatless section.","created_at":"2026-02-27T08:42:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T08:43:17Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116205#discussion_r2863210288","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116205","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2863210288"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116205#discussion_r2863210288"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116205"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2863210288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":35,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":16,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2865026854","pull_request_review_id":3867720932,"id":2865026854,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6qxNcm","diff_hunk":"@@ -27,10 +29,13 @@\n \t</methods>\n \t<members>\n \t\t<member name=\"bar_beats\" type=\"int\" setter=\"set_bar_beats\" getter=\"get_bar_beats\" default=\"4\">\n+\t\t\tThe number of beats within a single bar in the audio track. See [member ResourceImporterMP3.bar_beats].\n \t\t</member>\n \t\t<member name=\"beat_count\" type=\"int\" setter=\"set_beat_count\" getter=\"get_beat_count\" default=\"0\">\n+\t\t\tThe length of the audio track, in beats. See [member ResourceImporterMP3.beat_count].","path":"modules/mp3/doc_classes/AudioStreamMP3.xml","commit_id":"529c859710e06386210d8173c81662e7d304ff7b","original_commit_id":"529c859710e06386210d8173c81662e7d304ff7b","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The resource importer uses `beat_count` to determine the end point of an audio track. It's at that point where the audio will loop, or end if played on interactive streams. `beat_count` is set manually.\r\nI used \"The length of the audio track, in beats.\" because we're indeed getting the length of the track in beats, and it tells you the behavior changing that property causes - it changes the length of the track (not in all, but many cases).\r\n\"Number of beats\" is correct too, but doesn't describe a behavior. IMO, it's easier to assume it just sets and returns the number of beats in a track, and that the property has no effect.\r\nLet me know what you think\r\n\r\nI'm also changing the definition in the ResourceImporters. See #116597\r\n\r\nEdit: I guess one option would be to change...\r\n\"The length of the audio track, in beats.\"\r\nto...\r\n\"The number of beats of the audio track. This property defines the end of the audio for looping, [AudioStreamPlaylist], and [AudioStreamInteractive]\"\r\n\r\nI was also going to mention this behavior in the `loop` properties, but decided to leave it for another PR.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c740a088-40e4-409e-96e7-d0441fcd6bac\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2026-02-27T15:58:17Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T16:36:20Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116205#discussion_r2865026854","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116205","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2865026854"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116205#discussion_r2865026854"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116205"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2865026854/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":35,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2863210288,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":16,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2867522558","pull_request_review_id":3870480277,"id":2867522558,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6q6uv-","diff_hunk":"@@ -27,10 +29,13 @@\n \t</methods>\n \t<members>\n \t\t<member name=\"bar_beats\" type=\"int\" setter=\"set_bar_beats\" getter=\"get_bar_beats\" default=\"4\">\n+\t\t\tThe number of beats within a single bar in the audio track. See [member ResourceImporterMP3.bar_beats].\n \t\t</member>\n \t\t<member name=\"beat_count\" type=\"int\" setter=\"set_beat_count\" getter=\"get_beat_count\" default=\"0\">\n+\t\t\tThe length of the audio track, in beats. See [member ResourceImporterMP3.beat_count].","path":"modules/mp3/doc_classes/AudioStreamMP3.xml","commit_id":"529c859710e06386210d8173c81662e7d304ff7b","original_commit_id":"529c859710e06386210d8173c81662e7d304ff7b","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuse